---
description: Never read or print .env files or secrets
alwaysApply: true
---

# Secrets

Do not read `.env`, `.env.local`, `.env.*`, or files that look like credentials.

Do not print, quote, or repeat secret values. To check configuration, report only variable **names** and whether they are set or empty.

The user fills keys themselves. Ask them to paste into `.env.local` and save; do not open that file.
